@startuml DGM_ONT_005
hide methods
hide fields
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction
class "Medicinal Product\n«Kind»" as MedicinalProduct
class "Pharmaceutical Substance\n«Kind»" as PharmaceuticalSubstance
class "Medicinal Product Presentation\n«Kind»" as MedicinalProductPresentation
class "Dosage Form Specification\n«Kind»" as DosageFormSpecification
class "Strength\n«Quality»" as Strength
class "Package Configuration\n«Kind»" as PackageConfiguration
class "Product Classification Scheme\n«Kind»" as ProductClassificationScheme
class "Classification Entry\n«Kind»" as ClassificationEntry
class "Product Classification Assignment\n«Relator»" as ProductClassificationAssignment
class "Market Listing\n«Relator»" as MarketListing
class "Organization\n«Kind»" as Organization
class "Regulatory Jurisdiction\n«Kind»" as RegulatoryJurisdiction
note "hasActiveSubstance: domain unspecified" as PNOTE1
note "classificationEntity: range unspecified" as PNOTE2
MedicinalProductPresentation --> MedicinalProduct : presentationOf
PNOTE1 --> PharmaceuticalSubstance : hasActiveSubstance
MedicinalProductPresentation --> DosageFormSpecification : hasDosageForm
MedicinalProductPresentation --> Strength : hasStrength
MedicinalProductPresentation --> PackageConfiguration : hasPackageConfiguration
ProductClassificationAssignment --> PNOTE2 : classificationEntity
ProductClassificationAssignment --> ClassificationEntry : classificationEntry
ClassificationEntry --> ProductClassificationScheme : entryInScheme
MarketListing --> MedicinalProductPresentation : listingPresentation
MarketListing --> Organization : listingResponsibleOrganization
MarketListing --> RegulatoryJurisdiction : listingJurisdiction
MedicinalProduct .. PharmaceuticalSubstance : ≠ protected distinction
MedicinalProduct .. MedicinalProductPresentation : ≠ protected distinction
legend left
  Stereotypes are explicit textual semantics.
  Dashed != lines = registered protected distinctions.
  Endpoint-unspecified notes preserve absent OWL constraints.
endlegend
@enduml
